  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping nature-based solutions Sidoardjo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Indonesian government has asked for technical support in the improvement of the regional aquaculture sector in Sidoardjo, whilst improving coastal sediment management and the conservation of the mangrove ecosystem.This assignment provides a scoping for the potential of the implementation of nature-based solutions, including the technical and institutional settings. The lessons learnt in this case study will also be used to improve the uptake of nature-based solutions on a larger scale in Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
